=== Prompt ===
Who is Pikachu?

=== Normal Response ===
Pikachu is a fictional character in the Pokémon franchise, created by Game Freak. It is a species of Pokémon, which are creatures that can be caught, trained, and battled in the Pokémon video games, anime, and other media. Pikachu is a small, electric mouse-like Pokémon that is known for its yellow body, large, round, brown eyes, and two ears on top of its head that resemble a cap. It is one of the most recognizable and popular Pokémon, and is often associated with the character Ash Ketchum, the protagonist of the Pokémon anime series. Pikachu is a normal-type Pokémon, but it can also learn electric-type moves. It evolves from Pichu when it reaches a certain level, and it can also evolve into Raichu if it is exposed to a Thunder Stone or a Thunderstone in the games, or if it is leveled up while holding a Thunderstone in the anime. Pikachu is known for its electric attacks, such as Thunderbolt and Thunder, and it is also known for its ability to use its tail to store electricity. It is a popular character in the Pokémon franchise and has appeared in numerous video games, the Pokémon anime series, movies, and other media.

